OL,3,GNEWSACandidates named for five-way
OL,4,Aby-election fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FCandidates have been confirmed for an
OL,7,Fupcoming by-election on a council in
OL,8,FLeicestershire.
OL,10,FVoters in Charnwood Borough Council's
OL,11,FWreake Valley ward will go to the polls
OL,12,Fon Thursday 17 September to choose a
OL,13,Fsuccessor to Green councillor Laurie
OL,14,FNeedham who resigned her seat earlier
OL,15,Fthis month.
OL,17,FThe campaign will be a five-way contest
OL,18,Fbetween Labour, the Green Party, Reform
OL,19,FUK, the Conservatives and the Liberal
OL,20,FDemocrats.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
