OL,3,GNEWSACandidates named for five-way
OL,4,Aby-election fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council is currently run by Labour,
OL,7,Fwhich holds 20 of its 54 seats,
OL,8,Ffollowing a deal with the Green Party
OL,9,Fwhich has seven councillors.
